jobs.description:
&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;Set a new pulse for healthcare!&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Senior Product Manager&lt;/strong&gt; to join the &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;DODO team&lt;/strong&gt; in the &lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;Platform domain&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Your mission will be to build and maintain the common building blocks of Doctolib&#39;s system with a &quot;Platform as a Product&quot; mindset, abstracting and simplifying complex, critical data infrastructure so that product teams can focus on what matters: building faster, better products for healthcare professionals and patients. You will work closely with 600+ engineers across 70+ teams, owning the vision and strategy for data management products that form the foundation of everything we build.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Working in the product team at Doctolib means building innovative products and features to improve the daily lives of care teams and patients. We operate in feature teams within an agile environment, collaborating closely with engineering, design, and business teams.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities include but are not limited to:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Own and align the 2-year vision for data storage at Doctolib, defining which datastore products we build, which we source off the shelf, and how they serve both the monolith and the growing ecosystem of services around it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Define the product strategy and roadmap for data management products used by 600+ engineers, spanning multiple datastores (PostgreSQL/Aurora, Kafka, Debezium, Couchbase), file storage, data access, and data lifecycle solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Drive reliability, recoverability, and cost transparency across teams, including SLOs, alert ownership, backup and restore testing, and per-team cost visibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Define the experience for managing production data for services outside the monolith and for new AI product storage needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Partner with Staff and Senior Staff Engineers to assess the impact of complex architectural decisions, facilitate consensus across diverse viewpoints, and align stakeholders on contested trade-offs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Measure and improve engineer satisfaction with data management products, leading projects end-to-end, from problem definition and specs writing to development validation, rollout, and impact follow-up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;Who you are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Before you read on: if you don&#39;t have the exact profile described below, but you feel this job description matches your skill set, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be a great fit if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Have at least 5 years of experience in Product Management with direct product ownership, working with developers, leading rituals, and writing specifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Have extensive experience with technical products and platforms, and a passion for solving complex, large-scale infrastructure challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Can drive change across large engineering organizations, you&#39;re comfortable influencing 600+ engineers across more than 70 teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Have proven experience building and launching products in a large-scale, international B2B environment, where moving fast without slowing down feature development is a constant challenge&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Are fluent in both English and French (C1 level minimum) and are comfortable working in an international environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Have an entrepreneurial mindset and the ambition to transform healthcare&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Free comprehensive health insurance (basic package) for you and your children&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;25 days of paid vacation per year, plus up to 14 days of RTT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Free mental health and coaching services through our partner Moka.care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Work from abroad for up to 10 days per year thanks to our flexibility days policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Lunch vouchers (Swile card) worth €8.50 per working day, with €4.50 covered by Doctolib&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;A subsidy from the work council to refund part of the membership to a sport club or a creative class&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;50% reimbursement of your public transport subscription&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;ParentCare Program: Enjoy full salary coverage (100%) during your first month of birth leave and 75% during the second, covered by Doctolib&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Enrollment in Doctolib&#39;s long-term employee value sharing plan called DoctoGrowth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;For caregivers and workers with disabilities, a package including an adaptation of the remote policy, extra days off for medical reasons, and psychological support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Relocation support in case of international mobility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Access to the best AI tools for coding, development and dedicated training&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;Our interview process&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Recruiter Interview (45m) - w Maxime&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Hiring Manager Interview (60m) - w Loïc&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Live-case Interview (90m)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Behavioral Interview (75m)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;At least one reference check&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;We want your experience to be clear, respectful, and transparent. Learn more about our hiring process on our &lt;a class=&quot;break-words font-semibold transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out hover:underline text-highlight hover:text-highlight-400 active:text-highlight-dark&quot; href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/tech-doctolib/getting-hired/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;candidate experience page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;Job details&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Permanent position&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Full-time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Paris, France&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Hybrid work setup (up to 2 remote days per week)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Start date: as soon as possible&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;We welcome everyone&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;At Doctolib, we are committed to improving access to healthcare for everyone. This translates into our recruitment process. We evaluate candidates based solely on qualifications and motivation, without any form of discrimination.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;The more diverse ideas are heard, the more our product will truly improve healthcare for all. You are welcome to apply to Doctolib, regardless of your gender, religion, age, sexual orientation, ethnicity, or disability.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;To ensure equal opportunities, we invite you to exclude personal information (e.g., pictures, age) from your applications. If you require any accommodation, please let us know for support during the hiring process.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;Join us in building the healthcare we all dream of!&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;pb-2 pt-4 heading-xl text-foreground&quot;&gt;Your data privacy&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @sm:pt-2 @sm:pb-[10px] @sm:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;All information provided is processed by Doctolib for application management. For data processing details, click here: &lt;a class=&quot;break-words font-semibold transition-all duration-200 ease-in-out hover:underline text-highlight hover:text-highlight-400 active:text-highlight-dark&quot; href=&quot;https://doctolib.legal/B2C-Privacy-Policy-Career-FR&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;France&lt;/a&gt;. Please contact hr.dataprivacy(at)doctolib.com for inquiries or to exercise your rights.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Manager* – Artificial Intelligence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Frankfurt am Main, Düsseldorf, Berlin, München (Hybrid) | &lt;strong&gt;Practice Area:&lt;/strong&gt; Technology &amp;amp; Engineering | &lt;strong&gt;Type:&lt;/strong&gt; Permanent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gestalte die Zukunft von Artificial Intelligence – von innovativen Produktideen bis zu skalierbaren Lösungen mit echtem Business Impact.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Die Rolle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;Product Manager* – Artificial Intelligence&amp;nbsp;bei Capco gestaltest du die Entwicklung und erfolgreiche Vermarktung innovativer AI-Produkte, Lösungen und Acceleratoren.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Du arbeitest an der Schnittstelle von Business, Technologie und Innovation. Dabei vernetzt du unterschiedliche Stakeholder, entwickelst unser AI-Produktportfolio strategisch weiter und übersetzt technologische Möglichkeiten in messbaren Mehrwert für unsere Kunden.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Du begleitest AI-Produkte von der ersten Idee über die Entwicklung bis zur erfolgreichen Markteinführung. &lt;strong&gt;Dabei setzt du auf AI-gestützte Arbeitsweisen, intelligente Automatisierung und den verantwortungsvollen Einsatz von AI-Technologien, um Produktentscheidungen zu verbessern, Entwicklungsprozesse effizienter zu gestalten und Innovationen schneller nutzbar zu machen.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deine Aufgaben&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Product Portfolio Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Du verantwortest die Weiterentwicklung eines Portfolios aus AI-Lösungen, Demonstratoren und Acceleratoren und identifizierst Potenziale für Skalierung und kommerzielle Nutzung.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Du koordinierst Product Owner, Business-Stakeholder und Engineering-Teams über verschiedene Geschäftsbereiche und internationale Standorte hinweg und sorgst für gemeinsame Prioritäten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Development &amp;amp; AI-Enabled Delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Du übersetzt Geschäftsanforderungen und Marktpotenziale in Produktstrategien, priorisierte Backlogs und Roadmaps. &lt;strong&gt;Dabei nutzt du geeignete AI-Tools und automatisierte Workflows, um Analysen, Produktentwicklung und Entscheidungsprozesse zu unterstützen.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go-to-Market &amp;amp; Commercialisation:&lt;/strong&gt; Du entwickelst überzeugende Value Propositions, unterstützt die Produktpositionierung und Sales-Enablement-Aktivitäten und arbeitest eng mit Business- und Account-Teams zusammen, um AI-Lösungen erfolgreich am Markt zu etablieren.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Innovation &amp;amp; Strategic Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Du identifizierst neue AI-Anwendungsfelder, einschließlich Generative AI und Agentic AI, und stellst die Abstimmung mit Unternehmensstrategien und globalen Initiativen sicher. &lt;strong&gt;Dabei berücksichtigst du Responsible-AI-Prinzipien, Governance-Vorgaben und menschliche Qualitätskontrollen.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dein Profil&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bringst Erfahrung im Produktmanagement, in der Technologieberatung oder im Innovationsmanagement mit und kannst komplexe Themen in strukturierte Produktstrategien übersetzen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du verfügst über ein gutes Verständnis moderner AI-Technologien, einschließlich Generative AI, Large Language Models und Agentic AI, sowie ihrer geschäftlichen Einsatzmöglichkeiten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du verstehst wirtschaftliche Zusammenhänge und kannst technologische Fähigkeiten in überzeugende Value Propositions, Business Cases und konkrete Produktanforderungen übersetzen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du kommunizierst klar, arbeitest gerne mit unterschiedlichen Stakeholdern zusammen und kannst interdisziplinäre Teams koordinieren sowie unterschiedliche Interessen miteinander verbinden.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du arbeitest eigenverantwortlich, strukturiert und lösungsorientiert. &lt;strong&gt;Du bist offen für den Einsatz freigegebener AI-Tools, hinterfragst AI-generierte Ergebnisse kritisch und berücksichtigst Datenschutz, Governance und menschliche Entscheidungsverantwortung.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung in der Finanzdienstleistungsbranche oder in einem Beratungsunternehmen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung mit der Entwicklung, Skalierung oder Vermarktung digitaler Produkte und AI-basierter Lösungen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kenntnisse im Aufbau von AI-Produktportfolios, Acceleratoren oder wiederverwendbaren Technologiekomponenten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung mit AI-Governance, Responsible AI oder der Integration von AI-Lösungen in bestehende Unternehmensprozesse.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung mit internationalen, funktionsübergreifenden Teams sowie agilen Produktentwicklungsprozessen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Warum Capco&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gestalte innovative AI-Produkte und Lösungen mit echtem Mehrwert für führende Finanzdienstleistungsunternehmen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Arbeite in einer kollaborativen, offenen und unternehmerisch geprägten Beratungskultur mit kurzen Entscheidungswegen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Profitiere von kontinuierlicher Weiterbildung, Trainings und branchenspezifischen Zertifizierungen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Werde Teil internationaler Teams und arbeite mit AI-Expertinnen und -Experten an zukunftsweisenden Technologien.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Übernimm Verantwortung für eigene Initiativen und gestalte die digitale Transformation der Finanzdienstleistungsbranche aktiv mit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir bieten dir ein attraktives Benefits-Paket, das deine persönliche Entwicklung, dein Wohlbefinden und deine individuellen Bedürfnisse unterstützt:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Arbeitsmodelle:&lt;/strong&gt; Hybrides Arbeiten und flexible Arbeitsmodelle sind abhängig vom jeweiligen Projekteinsatz möglich.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Persönliche Begleitung:&lt;/strong&gt; Ein umfassendes Onboarding sowie ein persönlicher Coach und Buddy unterstützen dich beim Einstieg.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mobilität:&lt;/strong&gt; Profitiere von unseren Bike-Leasing-Programmen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Capco Benefits Card:&lt;/strong&gt; Monatliche Gutschrift in Höhe von 44 EUR.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Gesundheit &amp;amp; Wohlbefinden:&lt;/strong&gt; Regelmäßige Gesundheitschecks und Mental-Health-Kurse.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Familienservice:&lt;/strong&gt; Der PME-Familienservice bietet Unterstützung in unterschiedlichen Lebenssituationen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Kontinuierliches Feedback, interne Trainings und Weiterbildungsmöglichkeiten, beispielsweise über Udemy Business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Community &amp;amp; Networking:&lt;/strong&gt; Regelmäßige Firmenevents und After-Work-Veranstaltungen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Langfristige Perspektive:&lt;/strong&gt; Ein unbefristeter Arbeitsvertrag und vielfältige Entwicklungsmöglichkeiten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Arbeitskultur:&lt;/strong&gt; Eigenverantwortung, flache Hierarchien und schnelle Entscheidungswege.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Internationales Umfeld:&lt;/strong&gt; Ein dynamisches, wachsendes Unternehmen mit vielfältigen Möglichkeiten, eigene Ideen und Talente einzubringen.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inklusion bei Capco&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wir möchten unseren Bewerbungsprozess für alle Menschen zugänglich und unkompliziert gestalten. Solltest du während des Bewerbungsprozesses Unterstützung oder individuelle Anpassungen benötigen, sprich uns gerne an – wir helfen dir weiter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bei Capco schätzen wir unterschiedliche Perspektiven, Erfahrungen und individuelle Stärken. Wir sind überzeugt, dass Vielfalt und authentische Zusammenarbeit entscheidend zu unserem gemeinsamen Erfolg beitragen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unsere &lt;strong&gt;#BeYourselfAtWork&lt;/strong&gt;-Kultur fördert Individualität, gegenseitigen Respekt und Zusammenarbeit. Diese Werte prägen unseren täglichen Umgang miteinander sowie unsere Partnerschaften mit unseren Kunden.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*Wichtig ist nur, dass wir zueinander passen (m/w/d) #beyourselfatwork.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Celonis Services is the delivery engine of our Celonis Customer Organization, responsible for turning the Celonis platform into measurable, business-critical outcomes for our customers. In the AI era, our role has elevated: as AI agents like our own Apollo take on more of the technical build, our people focus on the work that drives real impact—understanding our customers&#39; business-critical problems, designing the solutions that solve them, and quantifying the value delivered. Our Deployment Engineers and Deployment Architects pair deep domain and industry expertise with serious platform mastery and AI-augmented delivery, directing agentic systems while owning the judgment, architecture, and customer relationships that AI cannot replace. We deliver faster and smarter than ever, and we own the outcome: solution go-live, solution adoption, initial value realization support and the long-term success of our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Principal Project Manager&lt;/strong&gt;, you will support end-to-end implementations of Celonis’ technology across our largest and most strategic customers. You will articulate Celonis’ product positioning to customers and collaborate with Sales, Partners and Value Engineering to establish Celonis’ Services Value proposition and create statements of work with customers during the pre-sales phase.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will assist customers in understanding how to build best practice and enduring capabilities, are responsible for identifying further Services needs by the customer whilst engaged and responsible for customer satisfaction throughout a customer&#39;s engagement with Celonis.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex transformational customer programs, shape and define the project outcome and then steer towards it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Planning, scheduling, and management of project timelines and activities from project kick-off through to training, ensuring each project is delivered on time and meets the customers&#39; requirements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage resources, schedule, scope and budget on multiple projects by creating and maintaining detailed project plans that emphasize speed to delivery and maximise the efficient use of resources needed to meet the requirements.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboration with senior executives, process owners and technical teams within each customer to understand their goals, objectives and requirements and to ensure their successful implementation. You will be their primary point of contact for product feature requests and escalation of support issues.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regularly communicate project status, covering key discussion items, action items, risks and issues. Keep projects up to date in the Celonis Professional Services Automation System to enable accurate and timely project and portfolio reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively manage and escalate risks and issues internally to Celonis management and externally to customer project sponsors to minimize impact to project success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide guidance and mentoring to the implementation team, including partner resources, to ensure Celonis methodology is being followed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use your experience to contribute to the continual improvement of Celonis Services methods as well as the maturing field expertise and best practices.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Client-facing Project Management experience in enterprise software implementations, managing multiple projects concurrently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience in project management disciplines, including documenting and maintaining project plans, risk/issue/action logs, and driving problem resolution in partnership with customers and Celonis executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and a background in consulting with a proven ability to manage stakeholders and project timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in people managing consulting teams both onshore and offshore.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in positioning Services, writing proposals and “statement of works” within a complete ecosystem (customers and partners).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A history of working with an ecosystem of partners and managed co-delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to effectively set and manage customer expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills, especially in applying technology solutions to core business problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability and willingness to be certified in Celonis products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project management certifications (PMP, Prince2, or Safe/Agile).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelors or Masters in Computer Science, Engineering, Mathematics or other related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of Artificial Intelligence Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on an artificial intelligence tool to match the information from your resume to the relevant Celonis job descriptions. This processing is limited to the information provided in your resume or in your candidate profile. The tool produces a match score per candidate for a role, suggests preliminary ranking, and provides recommendations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The tool is only used for support in parts of the job application process, including to facilitate the identification of the relevant Celonis Jobs for candidates and recruiters. All final decisions are made by hiring managers and the Celonis talent acquisition team. Hiring managers and HR specialists use this tool responsibly, are aware of the risk of potential bias, and are equipped to mitigate it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;Digitale transformatie is pas echt succesvol wanneer strategie, technologie en mensen samenkomen. Als Senior Projectmanager bij HSO leid jij CRM-implementaties die organisaties helpen beter met hun klanten te werken. Je werkt met de nieuwste Microsoft Cloud-technologie en stuurt teams aan in uitdagende projecten. Daarbij combineer je overzicht, leiderschap en inhoudelijke betrokkenheid. Zo maak jij het verschil tussen een systeem implementeren en echte businessimpact realiseren&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Taken&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- Als Senior Projectmanager leid je Dynamics 365 CRM-implementaties bij onze klanten van start tot succesvolle livegang. Je bent eindverantwoordelijk voor de voortgang, kwaliteit, scope en het budget van je projecten, en zorgt dat teams en stakeholders steeds dezelfde koers varen.&lt;br&gt;- Je werkt op het snijvlak van business en technologie. Samen met de klant vertaal je strategische doelen naar een duidelijke projectaanpak en een haalbare roadmap. Je begeleidt workshops, structureert requirements en zorgt dat CRM-processen zoals sales, marketing en service effectief worden ondersteund door Dynamics 365.&lt;br&gt;- Binnen het project stuur je een multidisciplinair team van (business) consultants, developers en solution architects aan. Je houdt overzicht over planning en afhankelijkheden, stuurt actief op risico’s en zorgt dat beslissingen tijdig worden genomen. Daarbij weet je complexe trajecten te structureren en verwachtingen van stakeholders op verschillende niveaus te managen.&lt;br&gt;- Onze projecten maken vaak deel uit van bredere Microsoft Cloud-transformaties, waarbij oplossingen zoals Dynamics 365 CRM, Field Service en Power BI samenkomen. In deze omgeving zorg jij voor structuur, richting en resultaat – en help je klanten niet alleen een systeem te implementeren, maar hun manier van werken daadwerkelijk te verbeteren.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vereisten&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;- Minimaal 5 jaar ervaring met CRM-implementaties als Projectmanager - dit is essentieel!&lt;br&gt;- Je deelt onze mindset: kritisch denken, ondernemend zijn en resultaatgericht werken.&lt;br&gt;- Uitstekende beheersing van het Engels voor internationale projecten.&lt;br&gt;- Jouw managementvaardigheden zijn consultatief, anticiperend en inspirerend, waardoor het team effectief functioneert.&lt;br&gt;- Ervaring met het Microsoft-platform, met name Dynamics 365 CRM, is een pre.&lt;br&gt;- Aantoonbare kennis van projectmanagementmethodieken, zoals PRINCE2, PMI of IPMA C/D-certificering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Werken bij HSO is uitdagend, we willen je daar graag een goede beloning voor teruggeven. Naast goede primaire voordelen bieden:&lt;br&gt;- Een competitief salaris, een jaarlijkse bonus op basis van bedrijfs-, team- en individuele prestaties;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;- 25 Vakantiedagen met de mogelijkheid om er 35 van te maken; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;- Hybride werken, vanuit huis, op kantoor (Rotterdam, Veenendaal);&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;- EUR 65,- netto vitaliteitsbudget – we vinden het belangrijk dat we gezond blijven en een veilige werkplek hebben, zowel op kantoor als remote; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;- Je kunt deelnemen aan het leasefietsplan; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;En vooral een leven lang leren. Op dag één start jouw onboardingprogramma, daarnaast krijg je een persoonlijk studiebudget dat je kunt inzetten voor jouw professionele ontwikkeling en ontvang je ook een GoodHabitz account, een online trainingstool voor je persoonlijke ontwikkeling.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ben jij klaar om grootschalige Microsoft-applicatieprojecten te leiden? Sluit je aan bij ons team als Senior Projectmanager D365 CRM.&lt;br&gt;Neem contact op met onze recruit Joseph &lt;a ----------
