&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align: justify; line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You belong here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At Upsun, we celebrate diversity in all its forms and are committed to fostering an inclusive, equitable, and supportive workplace where everyone can thrive. We embrace and value different perspectives, backgrounds, and experiences, because they make us stronger as a team. Whoever you are, wherever you&#39;re from, and whatever path you&#39;ve taken, you are welcome here. We encourage you to bring your whole self to work, connect with others, and share your passion. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you need accommodations at any stage of our hiring process, please let us know. We&#39;re here to ensure an accessible and comfortable experience for you.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;The Engagement tribe sits at the heart of SumUp&#39;s merchant experience, responsible for the product surfaces that 4.3 million business owners interact with every day, from the information they see about their business to the actions they take to grow it. As our Senior Product Manager, you&#39;ll own the merchant facing SuperApp end to end, a rare individual contributor role spanning product strategy, UX quality, and squad delivery, on the single surface the wider product organisation depends on to build and ship effectively. If you&#39;re looking for a role where your product decisions have a direct impact on how millions of businesses run and scale every day, this is it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Own the end to end product experience of our SuperApp across iOS, Android and web dashboard, raising the bar on UX quality, information architecture, and navigation for the surfaces merchants rely on most&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Spot and execute activation, upsell, cross sell, and retention opportunities that measurably grow engagement and long term value for merchants&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Shape the product strategy that makes the SuperApp an essential, everyday tool for small business owners running their business globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Act as the main point of contact for stakeholders across the business who depend on the SuperApp to reach merchants, partnering closely with design and data on priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Build strong working relationships across engineering, design, and commercial teams, turning direct merchant insight into a clear, prioritised roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll be great for this role if:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Track record leading a product squad end to end, from strategy through to shipped outcomes in engagement, retention, or monetisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Strong technical or analytical foundation, whether from an engineering background or hands on experience as a data or business analyst, with the ability to think in systems and structure ambiguous problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Comfort working fluently with both qualitative and quantitative data to inform decisions, rather than relying on others to surface the answer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Strong visual and UX judgement, with experience partnering closely with design and giving clear, constructive feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Ability to build a well reasoned product strategy independently, without needing a dedicated research or strategy function to get there&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Experience advocating for merchants, with a track record of translating their everyday problems into practical product decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you should join SumUp:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 Opportunity to work with SumUppers globally on large-scale fintech products used by millions of businesses worldwide, from our Berlin office. This involves an office-first setu&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌈 Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion: be part of a workplace that values and promotes diversity, fostering an inclusive environment where everyone&#39;s perspectives are respected and embraced&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚀 Enrolment onto our Virtual Stock Option programme: you will own a stake in SumUp&#39;s future success&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 A dedicated annual L&amp;amp;D budget of €2000 for your individual development, which can be used to attend conferences and/or advance your career through further education 💶 A corporate pension scheme where we match up to 20% of your contributions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏖 Generous time off: enjoy 28 days of paid leave plus public holidays and special leave days&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;🏙 Numerous other benefits such as Urban Sports Club subsidy, Kita placement assistance, subsidised office lunches&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌴 Break4me: 1-month sabbatical after 3 years of service&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔗 Referral Bonus: earn additional rewards by referring talented individuals to join the SumUp team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About SumUp:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be empowered to do more that matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, we&#39;re on a mission to empower small businesses across the globe by providing simple and affordable tools that allow them to thrive. Today, over 4 million businesses in 37 markets rely on SumUp as their financial partner to manage payments, finance and customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to small businesses is reflected in &lt;a class=&quot;text-primary underline cursor-pointer&quot; href=&quot;https://youtu.be/9DG64C3moeQ?si=YpcWuBNBTOQPzeLI&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;our diverse team&lt;/a&gt; of over 3,000 SumUppers from over 90 nationalities, united by global collaboration and an innovative mindset. &lt;a class=&quot;text-primary underline cursor-pointer&quot; href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/culture/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Our core values&lt;/a&gt; lay the foundation for who we are and what we stand for, shaping our work culture and driving our success. We foster inclusivity and a continuous learning culture, providing a safe space for personal and professional growth. Our differences make us unique and strong as we strive to create an environment where everyone belongs and feels supported, no matter how they identify.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer, actively seeking and embracing diversity in our workforce. We don&#39;t make hiring or employment decisions based on race, colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by company policy. Our commitment extends beyond recruitment to creating a safe and respectful workplace where harassment of any form is strictly prohibited. Discover more about our culture and opportunities on our &lt;a class=&quot;text-primary underline cursor-pointer&quot; href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;careers website&lt;/a&gt;, and follow our journey on &lt;a class=&quot;text-primary underline cursor-pointer&quot; href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/sumup/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;text-primary underline cursor-pointer&quot; href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidesumup/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a class=&quot;text-primary underline cursor-pointer&quot; href=&quot;https://www.tiktok.com/@insidesumup&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;TikTok&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h3&gt;🧡 About Alma&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Alma, we believe sustainable commerce depends on fair, well‑balanced trade. Because finance plays a pivotal role in business, our mission is to put it back in its rightful place - serving merchants and consumers. Our installment and deferred payment solutions help merchants boost sales by 20% or more, increase customer loyalty, and deliver a seamless shopping experience - without encouraging bad debt. As the buy now pay later leader in France and active in 10 European countries, we&#39;ve empowered over +25,000 merchants and 10 million consumers. With 400+ Almakers and €100M+ ARR, Alma is scaling rapidly across Europe as a member of the Next40, and we&#39;re just getting started!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;👐 About the team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join the Checkout Experience squad within Alma’s Consumer Tribe, reporting to &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/in/tetianavorgul/&quot;&gt;Tetiana&lt;/a&gt;, Group Product Manager. The squad is composed of an Engineering Manager and several Software Engineers, and works on key parts of Alma’s consumer checkout experience across online and in-store journeys.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Product Manager, you will join as an individual contributor and take ownership of strategic product topics spanning checkout conversion, account creation and identity verification. You will work at the intersection of consumer experience, merchant needs, business performance and regulatory requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This position is a permanent contract (CDI) based in Paris with a hybrid working model.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;💼 About the job&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make checkout simpler and more effective:&lt;/strong&gt; Own and improve Alma’s checkout experience across e-commerce and in-store journeys, reducing friction and supporting conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn complexity into trusted experiences:&lt;/strong&gt; Own account creation and identity verification journeys, integrating KYC and CCD2 requirements into clear and seamless customer flows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test, learn and repeat:&lt;/strong&gt; Use funnel analysis, customer insights and experimentation to identify opportunities, measure impact and continuously improve the product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make it happen together:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with cross-functional stakeholders to prioritize the roadmap and balance consumer, merchant, business, risk and compliance needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🧰 You will work with&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Slack&lt;/strong&gt; for day-to-day cross-functional communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notion&lt;/strong&gt; for product documentation, briefs and roadmaps&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Linear&lt;/strong&gt; for backlog and delivery tracking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Figma&lt;/strong&gt; for product design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Metabase&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;Looker&lt;/strong&gt; for data analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🧩 About you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;To succeed in this job&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have proven experience as a Product Manager working on checkout, e-commerce, payments or another high-volume consumer transaction experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand conversion funnels and experimentation, and are comfortable using data to identify opportunities, define success metrics and prioritize initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can turn complex customer needs, business constraints and regulatory requirements into simple, intuitive product experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You demonstrate strong ownership, structured problem-solving and effective cross-functional collaboration, while using AI tools to improve your product work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;And it will be nice if you...&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience with account creation, identity verification, authentication, KYC or fraud prevention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have built products in regulated environments, ideally within payments, BNPL, lending, consumer finance or another financial services context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have worked on in-store, POS or omnichannel experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have experience with European markets or an interest in emerging purchase journeys, including agentic commerce and AI-assisted transactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Don&#39;t meet every single requirement? At Alma, we believe great hires come from diverse paths. If this role excites you, we encourage you to apply. We value potential, curiosity and the ability to grow as much as experience.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🧘 What&#39;s in it for you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you join, you will be able to grow and impact on:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive measurable impact on Alma’s checkout conversion across both e-commerce and in-store experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a strategic product scope at the intersection of checkout, payments, identity and regulation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape the future of checkout, including new purchase journeys initiated by AI agents and LLM assistants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🤑 Compensation &amp;amp; benefits&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary based on 12 months&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Profit-sharing and employee savings plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health insurance: 100% covered by Alma including family package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Disability insurance: 100% covered by Alma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sport: partnerships with Gymlib and Classpass, or €30/month reimbursement for your sports activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maternity/paternity leave: salary maintained at 100% during leave with no seniority requirement. Return to work at 4/5 schedule paid at 100% for 8 weeks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sustainable Mobility Package (FMD): €544.80/year (excluding full-remote contracts)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meal vouchers: €10/day, 50% covered by Alma&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health: free access to MindDay platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid time off: 25 days/year (+ additional paid leave granted for employees on executive contracts)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to our Learning &amp;amp; Development Platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 weeks of full remote possible per year in summer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🎯 Interview Process&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Video call with a Talent Acquisition team member to understand your path, motivation &amp;amp; present you the role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Video call with your future manager to deep dive the role, the team, your profile and answer all your questions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Case study presentation with 2 team members (ideally in house) to assess your practical knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A coffee chat to further assess your skills and team fit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;References check.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;🌍 Diversity &amp;amp; Inclusion&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Alma, we believe that diversity fuels innovation and makes our community stronger. We are committed to building a workplace where every person feels seen, respected, and empowered to do their best work whatever their gender, background, ethnicity, age, sexual orientation, religion, disability or lived experience. As an equal opportunity employer, we welcome applicants from all walks of life, and all employment decisions are made based on qualifications, merit, and business needs.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr">Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h1 class=&quot;section-header section-header--large font-primary&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;About Digital Asset &amp;amp; the Canton Network&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Digital Asset builds the technologies that are reshaping the foundations of financial markets. Our mission is to create the world’s most trusted, privacy-enabled, and interoperable digital infrastructure for global finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the heart of this mission is the Canton Network - the blockchain purpose-built for institutional finance. Uniquely combining privacy, compliance, and scalability, Canton enables real-time, secure settlement across multiple asset classes. Governed by the Canton Foundation with participation from leading financial institutions, it is the proven link between the promise of blockchain and the power of global finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2014 and headquartered in New York City, with offices in London, Zurich, Budapest, Hong Kong, and Sydney— we are on a mission to transform finance— and that transformation is now playing out rapidly on the Canton Network.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you’re interested in playing a crucial role at the intersection of traditional and crypto-capital markets and want to help bring the next trillion dollars of finance on-chain, join us.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;isPasted&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Canton Network is delivering what others promised but couldn’t: a blockchain for finance that actually works. As the only open layer 1 blockchain network with configurable privacy and controls sufficient for regulatory compliance, it is the venue where DeFi and TradFi are converging.&lt;/p&gt;
We are looking for a visionary Principal Product Manager to lead our Stablecoins &amp;amp; Onchain Payments product activation program. This is not just a &quot;feature-owner&quot; role, but rather you will be the architect of how stablecoins &amp;amp; payments move across the Canton Network.&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As TradFi and DeFi converge, the demand for stable, regulatory-compliant and programmable units of value has never been higher. You will define and own the strategy for Digital Asset stablecoin &amp;amp; payments activation on the network, ensuring that stablecoin implementations and payment rails are not only technically superior but commercially dominant in contrast to other networks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and validate sustainable stablecoin and payment use cases on the Canton network, that can be activated together with institutional partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and execute the strategy and roadmap for stablecoins (fiat-backed, RWA-backed) and payments activation on the Canton Network, involving a cross-functional team of stakeholders and network participants (e.g. Tier 1 Stablecoin &amp;amp; RWA asset issuers).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with institutional partners to design workflows that connect legacy payment &amp;amp; PoS systems with Canton’s privacy-enabled ledger.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Legal and Compliance teams to ensure payment initiatives meet global standards (e.g. MiCA, Basel III) while maintaining the privacy benefits of the Canton Network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure that the scaling of stablecoin and payment use cases focuses on high-availability, security and low-latency settlement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and track Key Value Indicators (KVIs) for the use case activation on the network such as Mint/Burn volumes and Transaction Volume/Numbers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the primary product subject matter expert for stablecoins and payments use cases and activation within Digital Asset.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of Product Management experience, with at least 3 years focused on stablecoins and payments .&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of shipping products related to stablecoins use case intersecting with aspects of treasury management, cross-border payments, PoS provision or automated clearing houses (ACH)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of the stablecoin and payments stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of blockchain technology &amp;nbsp;is required and it would be great to have a familiarity with payments focussed layer 1/2 ecosystems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;While not a developer, you can confidently discuss application architecture, smart contract logic, and settlement workflows with engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building for B2B or B2B2C environments where security, compliance and &quot;five-nines&quot; reliability are non-negotiable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable discussing business models, pricing strategies and tokenomics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BIG BONUS: Direct experience with the Canton Network, Daml, or building institutional-grade Stablecoin payment applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are a hybrid workplace company, so you need to be willing to work at least 3 days per week from one of our offices (New York, Zürich, London or Budapest).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The range below may vary if based outside the New York tri-state area (New York, New Jersey, and Connecticut). Base salaries are determined during our interview process, during which we assess the candidate&#39;s experience, skills, and capabilities against internal peers and the scope and responsibilities of the position.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;US Pay Transparency&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$200,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$250,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Digital Asset, we are committed to compensation structures that reward impact consistently across our global teams. We support our people at every stage of life with comprehensive, family-forward benefits and flexible working models designed to help you do your best work.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; We offer a comprehensive benefits package designed to support the well-being of our team members. Health and insurance benefits vary by region to ensure local relevance and compliance, and may include medical, dental, and vision coverage.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Employer &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Digital Asset is an equal opportunity employer committed. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, national origin, sex, religion, sexual orientation, age, disability, citizenship status, veteran status, or any other basis protected by applicable law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment Eligibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; If and as required by applicable law, all persons hired to work at Digital Asset will be required to verify identity and eligibility to work in the location for which they have an offer to work and to complete the necessary employment eligibility verification documents upon hire.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
