&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Level Up Your Career with Zynga!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Zynga, we bring people together through the power of play. As a global leader in interactive entertainment and a proud label of Take-Two Interactive, our games have been downloaded over 6 billion times—connecting players in 175+ countries through fun, strategy, and a little friendly competition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From thrilling casino spins to epic strategy battles, mind-bending puzzles, and social word challenges, our diverse game portfolio has something for everyone. Fan-favorites and latest hits include FarmVille™, Words With Friends™, Zynga Poker™, Game of Thrones Slots Casino™, Wizard of Oz Slots™, Hit it Rich! Slots™, Wonka Slots™, Top Eleven™, Toon Blast™, Empires &amp;amp; Puzzles™, Merge Dragons!™, CSR Racing™, Harry Potter: Puzzles &amp;amp; Spells™, Match Factory™, and Color Block Jam™—plus many more!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2007 and headquartered in California, our teams span North America, Europe, and Asia, working together to craft unforgettable gaming experiences. Whether you&#39;re spinning, strategizing, matching, or competing, Zynga is where fun meets innovation—and where you can take your career to the next level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us and be part of the play!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define and elevate the artistic vision.&lt;/strong&gt; Drive the visual direction of new and existing casual mobile games, exploring distinctive and engaging art styles that support gameplay, strengthen the player experience and bring both new and established IP to life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead through hands-on creativity.&lt;/strong&gt; Create high-quality concepts, mock-ups and game-ready assets across 2D, 3D and AI-assisted workflows. Set the benchmark for artistic excellence through your own work, from early exploration to final in-game implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion AI-driven creative workflows.&lt;/strong&gt; Explore and integrate AI-assisted tools into the art production process, combining technical expertise with strong artistic judgment. Develop efficient, repeatable workflows that accelerate iteration while maintaining creative quality and visual consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prototype, iterate and innovate.&lt;/strong&gt; Rapidly develop and test visual concepts, using player insights, feedback and performance data to refine the artistic direction. Embrace experimentation and adapt quickly to identify the strongest creative opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provide artistic leadership and mentorship.&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a creative reference for artists across game art, VFX, UI and animation. Share expertise, provide constructive feedback and help raise the overall quality of the team&#39;s work through collaboration and mentorship, without the need for direct people management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate across disciplines.&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with game designers, developers, producers and marketing teams to ensure artistic decisions align with gameplay objectives, technical requirements and the overall player experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive quality and consistency.&lt;/strong&gt; Establish and maintain high visual standards throughout development, ensuring that art assets, styles and creative solutions deliver a cohesive, polished and engaging experience for players.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills to create thrills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience as a Lead or Principal Artist in the gaming industry, with a strong portfolio demonstrating artistic excellence and creative ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with AI-assisted art creation and a passion for exploring emerging creative technologies, combining technical expertise with 2D and 3D mastery to deliver compelling visual styles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional artistic skills and hands-on expertise across both 2D and 3D art production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong art direction capabilities, with the ability to define, develop and execute compelling visual styles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience with AI-assisted art creation and a passion for exploring emerging creative technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An excellent understanding of casual mobile game aesthetics, visual trends and player expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to rapidly prototype, iterate and adapt creative work in a fast-paced development environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of game art pipelines, technical constraints and in-game asset implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A player-focused mindset, with the ability to connect artistic decisions to gameplay and engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to influence creative direction, mentor fellow artists and elevate artistic quality without formal management responsibilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and collaboration skills, with the ability to work effectively across multiple disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in small, agile teams, new game development or rapid prototyping environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience implementing art assets directly in Unity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in world building, animation, VFX or video production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing new IP or adapting established IP for new game experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or optimizing AI-assisted art production pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience contributing to the visual direction of successful casual mobile games.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are proud to be an equal opportunity employer, which means we are committed to creating and celebrating diverse thoughts, cultures, and backgrounds throughout our organization.&amp;nbsp; Employment with us is based on substantive ability, objective qualifications, and work ethic – not an individual’s race, creed, color, religion, sex or gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin or ancestry, alienage or citizenship status, physical or mental disability, pregnancy, age, genetic information, veteran status, marital status, status as a victim of domestic violence or sex offenses, reproductive health decision, or any other characteristics protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an equal opportunity employer, we are committed to providing the necessary support and accommodation to qualified individuals with disabilities, health conditions, or impairments (subject to any local qualifying requirements) to ensure their full participation in the job application or interview process. Please contact us at ----- to request any accommodations or for support related to your application for an open position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware that Zynga does not conduct job interviews or make job offers over third-party messaging apps such as Telegram, WhatsApp, or others.&amp;nbsp; Zynga also does not engage in any financial exchanges during the recruitment or onboarding process, and will never ask a candidate for their personal or financial information over an app or other unofficial chat channel.&amp;nbsp; Any attempt to do so may be the result of a scamp or phishing attack, and you should not engage.&amp;nbsp; Zynga’s&amp;nbsp; in-house recruitment team will only contact individuals through their official Company email addresses (i.e., via a zynga.com, take2games.com, naturalmotion.com, smallgiantgames.com, themavens.com, gram.gs email domain).&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an Engineering Manager to lead Codeless, our internal Server-Driven UI (SDUI) platform team. In this role, you will lead a cross-functional team bridging mobile/web frontend engineering and core platform backend systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While this role is deeply rooted in modern UI architecture, its mission goes beyond standard UI development: Codeless empowers product teams across the organization to ship dynamic, native UI experiences dynamically from the backend—eliminating app store release bottlenecks, dramatically accelerating feature iteration, and establishing a unified UI schema across iOS, Android, and Web.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a role with broad impact, from hands-on technical guidance to championing web and mobile accessibility across the company. We&#39;re looking for a leader who excels at fostering collaboration and can confidently guide a concept from initial idea to robust implementation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Day-to-day in this role you’ll:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Strategy: &lt;/strong&gt;Build, mentor, and scale an engineering team responsible for our core Server-Driven UI platform (&quot;Codeless&quot;). Foster an inclusive, high-ownership engineering culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform Architecture &amp;amp; Evolution:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee the design and evolution of dynamic layout engines, declarative UI schemas, and client rendering frameworks across iOS, Android, and Web.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Developer Velocity &amp;amp; Platform Adoption:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with product feature teams to drive internal adoption of Codeless. Ensure the platform provides exceptional Developer Experience, clear tooling, robust design system integration, and seamless debugging workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Execution &amp;amp; Quality:&lt;/strong&gt; Set high technical standards for platform performance, payload optimization, caching strategies, backward compatibility, and graceful offline/fallback behavior across client devices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with Product Managers, Design System leaders, and Core Infrastructure engineers to align the Codeless roadmap with broader company initiatives and global design paradigms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll need to thrive&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Engineering Management:&lt;/strong&gt; 3+ years of experience managing software engineering teams, with a track record of coaching engineers, delivering complex platform initiatives, and driving technical strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;UI &amp;amp; Platform Domain Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong foundational background in mobile (iOS/Android) or modern web architecture (React, SwiftUI, Jetpack Compose, or declarative UI paradigms).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product &amp;amp; Platform Mindset:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Ability to treat internal product engineering teams as customers, evaluating platform success through developer velocity, adoption metrics, and rendering performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why join us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Deliveroo, you’ll do work that matters—solving real-world problems in a three-sided marketplace that’s constantly evolving. We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔧 Solve meaningful problems at real scale Work on a complex, always-on marketplace that impacts millions every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌱 See your impact, fast Ship, test and improve ideas quickly in a low-hierarchy, high-ownership environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 Grow through challenge and ownership Take on big, ambiguous problems and accelerate your career with strong support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 A culture built for builders High standards, collaboration, flexible working and continuous learning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 Share in the success you help create Competitive salary and equity options, so you’re rewarded for the impact you make.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;➡️ Want a deeper look at how we build? Check out our Tech Blog.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Explore our Engineering Interview Guide here to help you feel confident at each stage.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;SLSQ328R117&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you want to help solve the world&#39;s toughest problems with big data and AI? This is what we do every day at Databricks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a creative, execution-oriented Strategic Account Executive to join the Benelux team to maximise the phenomenal market opportunity that exists for Databricks within the Energy industry. Your mission will be to grow one of our most strategic energy customers. Experience selling to this sector is essential, as is experience in running large complex multi-national accounts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the RVP for Strategic Customers in the Benelux, as a Strategic Account Executive at Databricks you will come with an informed and compelling point of view on the Data, Analytics and AI space which will guide your successful strategy and together with both our teams and partners, allow you to provide exceptional value to our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work in partnership with the Global Account Manager and the broader Account team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will co-develop a business plan, with your team and ecosystem partners, that accelerates customer success to exceed quarterly/annual usage and booking goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will lead your team, customers and partners to identify impactful data and AI use cases whilst proving out their value on the Databricks Data Intelligence Platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will implement the data and AI transformation goals of your customer through a combination of strategic partnerships, well-scoped professional services, training and targeted Executive Engagement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will develop an understanding of technical product details and roadmap to build trust with executives and technical champions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will have experience developing strong relationships with large (global) Enterprises global accounts, managing virtual teams, and leading complex sales campaigns in major Energy accounts&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will have experience working in Data, Cloud, or SaaS industries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proof of exceeding sales quotas in high-growth Enterprise software companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will have experience driving usage and commit-based engagement models and strategies working with professional services and training teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will have experience co-selling and scaling your business with Cloud Vendors (AWS, Azure and Google Cloud teams) and Global Solution Integrators (GSI)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will have experience co-developing business cases and gaining support from C-level Executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will have experience of value-based selling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English is required, fluency in Dutch is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive culture where everyone can excel. We take great care to ensure that our hiring practices are inclusive and meet equal employment opportunity standards. Individuals looking for employment at Databricks are considered without regard to age, color, disability, ethnicity, family or marital status, gender identity or expression, language, national origin, physical and mental ability, political affiliation, race, religion, sexual orientation, socio-economic status, veteran status, and other protected characteristics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compliance&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;If access to export-controlled technology or source code is required for performance of job duties, it is within Employer&#39;s discretion whether to apply for a U.S. government license for such positions, and Employer may decline to proceed with an applicant on this basis alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Secure Every Identity, from AI to Human&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Identity is the key to unlocking the potential of AI. Okta secures AI by building the trusted, neutral infrastructure that enables organizations to safely embrace this new era. This work requires a relentless drive to solve complex challenges with real-world stakes. We are looking for builders and owners who operate with speed and urgency and execute with excellence.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is an opportunity to do career-defining work. We&#39;re all in on this mission. If you are too, let&#39;s talk.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Okta: The World’s Identity Company™&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About Okta &amp;amp; The TAM Team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Okta is the leader in Identity management and The World’s Identity Company™. Our mission is to build a more secure world by providing a neutral, powerful, and extensible platform that puts identity at the heart of the modern tech stack—securing customers, employees, partners, and AI agents. Two-thirds of the Fortune 100 trust Okta to power their identity journeys.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Technical Account Management (TAM) team is a global group of Okta product experts dedicated to driving long-term customer success. As a Senior TAM within our Strategic Workforce Identity segment, you will serve as the premier technical advisor and advocate for some of our largest enterprise customers (across Financial Services, Healthcare, Public Sector, and more), helping them elevate their technical maturity and maximize their Okta investment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Be Doing&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;1. Strategic Customer Partnership &amp;amp; Influence&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Trusted Advisor: Build deep, executive-level relationships, serving as the primary technical point of contact for customer identity owners and IT leadership (up to CxO).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic Roadmapping: Architect tailored technical success plans aligned with customer business objectives to drive platform adoption and secure Okta against competitive displacement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adoption &amp;amp; Expansion: Guide customers in expanding their Okta footprint across critical Workforce solutions, continuously improving their overall security posture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;2. Complex Problem Resolution &amp;amp; Advocacy&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Escalation Lead: Independently manage and resolve highly complex customer technical escalations, collaborating with Customer Success Managers (CSMs) as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Risk Mitigation: Proactively identify technical roadblocks, design robust mitigation plans, and drive them to resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Advocacy: Champion customer needs internally by collaborating with Okta Engineering, Product, and Support teams to influence product direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;3. Thought Leadership &amp;amp; Team Enablement&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge Sharing: Deliver workshops, best practice sessions, and vertical-specific insights to enhance customer security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Asset Creation: Author repeatable technical strategies and assets to level up the global TAM organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentorship: Actively mentor and develop peer TAMs to upskill technical capabilities across the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Workforce Identity Solutions You Will Support&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will provide deep technical guidance across Okta&#39;s comprehensive Workforce Identity lifecycle:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IAM: SSO, Adaptive MFA, Device Access, API Access Management, Secure Partner Access, Access Gateway, and Universal Directory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IGA: Lifecycle Management and Okta Identity Governance (OIG).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PAM: Privileged Access Management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ITDR: Identity Security Posture Management and Identity Threat Protection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring to the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Education&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of related professional IT experience (or 6+ years with a Master’s degree).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience as a TAM, Technical Consultant, Solution Architect, or Product Manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience working with Identity &amp;amp; Access Management (IAM) solutions or related security technologies is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education: BA/BS/MS in Computer Science, IT, or a related discipline (or equivalent experience).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Certifications: Okta Certified, CISSP, or equivalent certifications are highly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Technical Mastery (Workforce Identity Focus)&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Okta Architecture: Extensive hands-on proficiency mapping Okta feature sets to complex enterprise architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Federation Protocols: Strong understanding of modern identity protocols (SAML 2.0, OAuth, OpenID Connect, WS-Fed).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid Environments: Experience integrating legacy/non-standard applications that do not support modern federation protocols.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lifecycle &amp;amp; Provisioning: Deep knowledge of lifecycle management, automated provisioning, and integrations (e.g., SCIM, Okta Workflows, HR-driven provisioning, Active Directory).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SaaS Ecosystems: Familiarity deploying and securing key SaaS platforms (O365, Salesforce, Workday, Box).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Code Proficiency: Ability to read and modify existing quickstarts, code samples, or scripts to match customer requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Communication &amp;amp; Leadership&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive Presence: Exceptional communication skills with a proven ability to translate highly technical concepts into clear business outcomes for CxO-level audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Boundary Setting: Skilled at managing expectations, tracking portfolio health metrics, and setting healthy boundaries with internal and external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;xt0psk2 x1ghz6dp x1717udv x1wty727 x4gjf66 x15eiy0f x1lziwak x15472z4 x1qlqyl8 x15bjb6t x1s688f x14rh7hd xdj266r&quot; data-d-component=&quot;text&quot; data-d-inline=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;Location&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;amp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;Language&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;Requirements:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;This&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;is&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;hybrid&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;role,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;open&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;to&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;candidates&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;based&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;London,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;Munich,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;Paris,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;or&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;Warsaw.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;Fluency&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;in&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;both&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;German&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;and&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;English&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;is&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-d-streaming-word=&quot;&quot;&gt;mandatory.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-MM1&lt;br&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;br&gt;P26230_3599521&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Okta Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://rewards.okta.com&quot;&gt;Supporting Your Well-Being&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/okta-for-good/&quot;&gt;Driving Social Impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okta.com/company/talent-connection-community/&quot;&gt;Developing Talent and Fostering Connection + Community&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are intentional about connection. Our global community, spanning over 20 offices worldwide, is united by a drive to innovate. Your journey begins with an immersive, in-person onboarding experience designed to accelerate your impact and connect you to our mission and team from day one.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Okta is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, national origin, ancestry, marital status, age, physical or mental disability, or status as a protected veteran. We also consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest and convictions records, consistent with applicable laws.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If reasonable accommodation is needed to complete any part of the job application, interview process, or onboarding please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1EfiEYZrIyhA2X4Fijk0R3RKYOzNoS3wtvyM4nhbZnXE/edit&quot;&gt;use this Form&lt;/a&gt; to request an accommodation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Notice for New York City Applicants &amp;amp; Employees: Okta may use Automated Employment Decision Tools (AEDT), as defined by New York City Local Law 144, that use artificial intelligence, machine learning, or other automated processes to assist in our recruitment and hiring process. In accordance with NYC Local Law 144, if you are an applicant or employee residing in New York City, please&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://talent.okta.com/new-york-city-aedt-notice.html&quot;&gt;click here&lt;/a&gt; to view our full NYC AEDT Notice.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Shift delivers AI agents that transform insurers&#39; most critical work. By combining deep industry expertise and unmatched data resources, Shift provides proven results that have earned the trust of hundreds of the world&#39;s leading insurers. Our insurance-grade AI is accurate, explainable, and secure—empowering human experts to move with unmatched speed, total confidence, and a renewed focus on the people they serve.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;video poster=&quot;https://8595762.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/8595762/2026%20Website%20Refresh/2026%20Shift%20Brand%20Video/thumbnail-violet.jpg&quot; controls=&quot;controls&quot; width=&quot;300&quot; height=&quot;150&quot;&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;source src=&quot;https://8595762.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/8595762/2026%20Website%20Refresh/2026%20Shift%20Brand%20Video/2026%20Shift%20Brand%20Video%20(English).mp4&quot; type=&quot;video/mp4&quot;&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Your browser does not support the video tag.&lt;/video&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Our culture is built on innovation, trust, and a drive to transform the insurance industry through our SaaS platform. We come from more than 50 different countries and cultures and together we are creating the future of insurance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Learn more at &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.shift-technology.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;www.shift-technology.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Shift, we are building the next generation of AI-driven platform capabilities. We are looking for an experienced, hands-on &lt;strong&gt;Lead AI Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; in our Data &amp;amp; AI Platform Engineering team to drive our LLMOps roadmap and our most business-critical agentic use cases; someone who is deeply passionate about building, prototyping, and scaling modern AI/LLM systems, while leading a small team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-impact, high-visibility role for a senior builder who excels at the intersection of &lt;strong&gt;cutting-edge AI technologies&lt;/strong&gt; (Agentic frameworks, LLM orchestration, MCP, GenAI, MLOps) and &lt;strong&gt;production-grade software engineering&lt;/strong&gt;. You will lead a focused team of engineers and work directly with software engineers and product leaders to design, prototype, and ship state-of-the-art AI systems into production, while acting as the link with our Data Science team to align priorities with their needs and spread best practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you are a senior AI engineer looking for the next step in your career, where you can lead people and shape a roadmap &lt;strong&gt;without giving up hands-on coding and building&lt;/strong&gt;, this role is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build agentic systems (hands-on):&lt;/strong&gt; design and ship production-grade agentic workflows (LLM orchestration, tool calling, MCP, RAG, structured outputs), and define reference architectures that decide what a model handles and what deterministic code handles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own LLMOps standards:&lt;/strong&gt; evaluation harnesses, prompt and agent versioning, tracing (OpenTelemetry), cost and token governance, and release gates, with tenant-aware patterns that respect client data isolation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Evolve our ML platform:&lt;/strong&gt; be the technical owner of our Databricks-based ML platform (Unity Catalog, MLflow, CI/CD to serving on AKS, monitoring), and extend it toward the agent and prompt lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Run &amp;amp; Serve Open-Weight Models:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with our Cloud Ops team to design and deploy the architecture required to self-host open-weight foundation models internally. You will own the inference layer and model optimizations (latency, throughput), while collaborating seamlessly with Cloud Ops on GPU resource provisioning and cluster management.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Push the frontier:&lt;/strong&gt; run time-boxed POCs on emerging techniques, such as relational foundation models for claims fraud detection or agentic ingestion of medical billing sources to generate claim edits, with clear success criteria and a path to production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead and grow the team:&lt;/strong&gt; coach and develop 2 to 5 people, raise the technical bar through design and code reviews, and partner with product, SMEs, architecture, security and SRE.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE ARE LOOKING FOR&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agentic AI expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; proven experience building production agentic systems (Microsoft Agent Framework, OpenAI Agents SDK, PydanticAI, LangGraph or custom), and strong command of tool calling, MCP, RAG and evaluation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;MLOps and engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; high proficiency in Python; hands-on experience with experiment tracking, model registry, serving and monitoring (ideally Databricks and MLflow); backend services on Azure, Kubernetes, Terraform and event-driven patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Applied ML curiosity:&lt;/strong&gt; solid ML foundations, ability to judge new approaches critically; exposure to graph ML, fraud or claims data is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software design:&lt;/strong&gt; high proficiency in Python and strong experience with OOP; proven ability to design robust, maintainable software systems and write clean code, applying the right design patterns and software engineering best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; experience leading technical initiatives across stakeholders, and coaching or managing technical contributors (or a clear motivation to do so).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;English&lt;/strong&gt; fluency required; French is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;HOW YOU WORK (Shift High-Impact Behaviors)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Jump in and get things done:&lt;/strong&gt; You are a proactive builder who loves turning ambitious ideas into working code. You don&#39;t wait for permission to solve hard problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make things simpler:&lt;/strong&gt; You can break down complex AI concepts and architectures into clear, executable steps for engineers, data scientists, and non-technical partners alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Test &amp;amp; learn new things:&lt;/strong&gt; You are genuinely obsessed with the fast-moving AI landscape. You constantly experiment with new models, libraries, and papers, and know how to extract real product value from the hype.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communicate with impact &amp;amp; help others grow:&lt;/strong&gt; You lead by example and collaboration, upskilling team members through pair programming, code reviews, and pragmatic design discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
